      </div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span class="li"><span class="lsq" style="background:#00d4aa"></span>Condom (Q4)</span>
        <span class="li"><span class="lsq" style="background:#4f9cf9"></span>HIV test (Q13)</span>
        <span class="li"><span class="lsq" style="background:#f97316"></span>PrEP (Q21)</span>
